			"notes": "# 📦 Changelog\nNow that Cobblemon `1.8.0` is officially out, this version was able to be built against the stable release, rather than Release Candidates!\n\n### 🔧 Dependency Tweaks\n- To add MiniMessage support in upcoming releases, both `Adventure` version `5.14.2` and `Adventure Text MiniMessage` version `4.17.0` are now **required** and bundled with the mod.\n- Updated the minimum **required** `fabric-api` version to `0.116.6+1.21.1`.\n- Updated the minimum **required** `cobblemon` version to `1.8.0+1.21.1`.\n- Added `gooeylibs` as a **requirement**, with a minimum version of `3.1.0`.\n- Added `placeholder-api` as a **suggestion**, with a minimum version of `2.4.1+1.21`.\n- Added `luckperms` as a **suggestion**, with a minimum version of `5.4.139`.\n- Added `cobblemonsizevariation` as a **suggestion**, with a minimum version of `1.1.0`.\n- Added `neodaycare` as a **suggestion**, with a minimum version of `1.5.2` (was done for version `1.7.3`, requires an update).\n\n**Edit:** You should use `neodaycare` version `1.7.0` or above! This will be updated for next release.\n\n---\n\n### 💬 Chat & Hover Enhancements\n#### Hoverable Tooltips\n- Added support for base `Cobblemon` sizes!\n  - If the `CobblemonSizeVariation` mod is loaded, then the relevant configurations will take precedence.\n  - If `CobblemonSizeVariation` is not loaded, then all size-name-related information will be obtained from the base mod itself!\n---\n\n### 🐞 Bug Fixes\n- Fixed some `LuckPerms`-specific events being started, even if `LuckPerms` is not loaded."
		},
