			"notes": "# 📦 Changelog\n\n### ✨ New Features\n- Added the `[help]` chat parser!\n  - When used, a chat hoverable with all possible help parsers is displayed.\n- Added the `[help:shout]`, `[help:shouts]` and `[help:shouting]` chat parsers!\n  - When used, a chat hoverable with all possible shout parsers is displayed.\n- Added new parsing for pokémon that are Eggs, with additional NeoDaycare support.\n  - You can customize egg parser colors, as well as hatch progress messages.\n- Added the ability to display pokémon shininess through a gradient in chat hoverables.\n- Added the ability to display different colors for pokémon in chat hoverables, based on pokémon category.\n  - Pokémon categories include: custom (uses the custom aspects specified in `chat_aspects.toml`), legendary, mythical, ultra beast and regular.\n---\n\n### ⚙️ Configuration\n- Updated the default configuration files to reflect the latest changes.\n  -  You can always find the up-to-date default configurations [here](https://github.com/sergio-aguiar/MirageChatParser/tree/main/src/main/resources/defaults)!\n  - You can find the changes specific to this version update [here](https://github.com/sergio-aguiar/MirageEssentials/commit/541fe5fccb1aea8329a6896cf22199bb36632d44)!\n- Added the following color settings to the `chat_colors.toml` file:\n  - `Hoverable.BracketRegularColor`, `Hoverable.BracketLegendaryColor`, `Hoverable.BracketMythicalColor`, `Hoverable.BracketUltraBeastColor`, `Hoverable.BracketCustomColor`, `Tooltip.EggNicknameColor`, `Tooltip.EggHatchStageMessageColor `.\n- Added the following settings to the `chat_settings.toml` file:\n  - `Hoverable.UsePokemonCategoryHoverables`, `Hoverable.UseShinyGradientHoverables`, `EggTooltip.ShowEggNickname`, `EggTooltip.ShowEggHatchStepProgress`, `EggTooltip.ShowEggHatchStageMessages`.\n- Added the following string settings to the `chat_strings.toml` file:\n  - `EggStageMessages.EggStage0Top`, `EggStageMessages.EggStage0Bottom`, `EggStageMessages.EggStage1Top`, `EggStageMessages.EggStage1Bottom`, `EggStageMessages.EggStage2Top`, `EggStageMessages.EggStage2Bottom`, `EggStageMessages.EggStage3Top`, `EggStageMessages.EggStage3Bottom`,"
		},
